sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OPD as OPD Module
    participant Lab as Lab Module
    participant LPEP as Lab PEP
    participant LCer as Lab Cerbos PDP<br/>(sidecar)
    participant LDB as Lab Database
    participant Bus as Event Bus

    Note over OPD,Bus: Doctor orders a lab test — OPD calls Lab via service account

    OPD->>OPD: Doctor's request authorized<br/>at OPD boundary (user principal)

    OPD->>Lab: POST /lab/orders<br/>(OPD service-account JWT)
    Note over OPD,Lab: JWT claims: {sub: opd-svc,<br/>kind: service, iq_tenant_id: hospital_a}

    Lab->>LPEP: Intercept request
    LPEP->>LPEP: Construct principal from JWT
    Note over LPEP: Principal: {id: opd-svc,<br/>kind: service, roles: [opd_service]}

    LPEP->>LCer: CheckResources (loopback gRPC)
    Note over LPEP,LCer: Resource: {kind: lab:order}<br/>Action: create

    LCer->>LCer: Evaluate service-account policy<br/>→ opd_service + lab:order:create = ALLOW
    LCer-->>LPEP: EFFECT_ALLOW

    LPEP->>Lab: Proceed to business logic

    Lab->>LDB: Create lab order<br/>(iq_tenant_id, patient EMPI ID,<br/>test codes, originating_user_id)
    Note over LDB: originating_user_id preserved<br/>for audit trail (not for authz)

    LDB-->>Lab: Order saved
    Lab->>Bus: Publish lab.order.created event
    Lab-->>OPD: 201 Created (order ID)
